      ],
      "thumbnail": true,
      "preview_output": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "source_and_scope",
      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Source, setup and scope",
      "description": "VisA PCB photo: Yang Zou, Jongheon Jeong, Latha Pemula, Dongqing Zhang and Onkar Dabeer, SPot-the-Difference (ECCV 2022). CC BY 4.0: https://registry.opendata.aws/visa/. Resized/letterboxed from bundled PCB2 0000; no defects added. Source and hashes: ../../assets/showcase/SOURCES.md. No robot/controller operation. Local run identity example. Attach scope before queues/branches and guard results against the current context afterward. New execution graph, project reopen or flow reset rotates the unsaved session nonce; a rising Reset input advances generation. Run/acquisition tags are local payloads, not standard ROS header fields or motion permission.",
      "parameters": {},
      "position": [
        0,
        -300
      ],
      "node_size": "large",
      "exposed_inputs": [],
      "exposed_outputs": [],
      "thumbnail": true,
      "preview_output": ""
